§M{m001:CallbackAfter}
  §CL{c001:Counter:pub}
    §FLD{Action<i32>:onChange:pri} §E{cw} §LAM{lam001:v:i32} §C{Console.WriteLine} §A v §/C §/LAM{lam001}
    §FLD{i32:total:pri} 0

    §MT{mt001:Bump:pub} (i32:n) -> void
      §E{cw}
      §ASSIGN total (+ total n)
      §C{onChange} §A total §/C

    §MT{mt002:Peek:pub} (i32:n) -> i32
      §R (+ total n)
